flowchart LR
  packet[Packet ingress] --> xdp[XDP fast path\nparse / block list / SYN path\nsession update\nContract5 reconstruction\n5-bit index + score lookup]
  xdp --> pass[PASS]
  xdp --> drop[DROP]
  xdp -. future extension .-> tc[TC classifier\nextension point / future policy]
  loader[Rust loader] -. load maps .-> maps[BPF maps\nQUANTILE_BOUNDS + SCORE_TABLE]
